#
# Running it over docs/ rewraps prose and rewrites tables across 94 documents,
# which would make every future diff against a specification unreadable — and
# the specification is what the next person reads. VPS-000 owns the
# documentation standard; a code formatter does not get a vote.
#
# The findings logs are excluded for the same reason: they are prose records,
# not source.
